$f(x)=3|x-2|+|x|=$
$$
\left\{
\begin{matrix}
6-4x, & x<0,\\ 
6-2x, & 0\leq x\leq 2,\\ 
4x-6, & x>2,
\end{matrix}
\right.
$$
$所以不等式f(x)>2x等价于$
$$
\left\{
\begin{matrix}
6-4x>2x, & x<0
\end{matrix}
\right.
$$
或
$$
\left\{
\begin{matrix}
6-2x>2x, & 0\leq x\leq 2
\end{matrix}
\right.
$$
或
$$
\left\{
\begin{matrix}
4x-6>2x, & x>2.
\end{matrix}
\right.
$$
$解得x<0或0\leq x<\frac{3}{2}或x>3，$
$故不等式f(x)>2x的解集为(-\infty ,\frac{3}{2})\cup(3,+\infty ).$

